ween them as they head off to the summer festival...?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-06-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":4,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8XCbl7QJ6REzqc0taCnxPEKJXW5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8XCbl7QJ6REzqc0taCnxPEKJXW5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/77724/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"1509100","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hanabi and Iori are enjoying the summer festival. Konomi searches for them.\n\nWill Konomi be able to confess her feelings for Hanabi? What are Iori's true intentions?\n\nA love triangle (?) centered around Hanabi reaches its climax at the summer festival.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-06-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":4,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mzyh4Q2NFI6v2BXMDwGaYP1URCc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mzyh4Q2NFI6v2BXMDwGaYP1URCc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/77724/season/1/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/77724/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793452299625,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793452299625,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793452299625,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793452299625,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793452299625,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793452299625,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793452299625,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793452299625,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793452299625,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793452299625,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793452299625,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"checkedAt":1793452299625,"sta